        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium sulphate from sulfuric acid digestion of spodumene</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium sulphate from sulfuric acid digestion of spodumene
The multioutput-process "Sulfuric acid digestion of spodumene" delivers the co-products lithium carbonate and sodium sulfate. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
UUID: e58aee70-e777-300d-b0e7-ff6bda1e25dd
